 "remarks": "Welcome to 33 Raymond Terrace. This charming 3-bedroom, 1.5-bath Cape Cod offers a wonderful combination of comfort, character, and outdoor living. Inside, you'll find hardwood floors, a cozy family room with a fireplace, and a kitchen featuring stainless steel appliances. The spacious primary bedroom includes a half bath, while two additional bedrooms and a full bathroom provide plenty of living space. Step outside to a large Trex composite deck overlooking a beautifully landscaped, fenced backyard and a fire pit, perfect for entertaining or simply relaxing. Recent improvements include a NEW ROOF, along with central air conditioning, a bluestone walkway and patio, an attached one-car garage, and additional driveway parking. Conveniently located just a few blocks from East Norwalk Train Station and minutes from Calf Pasture Beach, shopping, restaurants, and parks. A great opportunity to enjoy all that East Norwalk has to offer.",
